{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2020-08-13 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': '3M Reports Qtrly Sales Of $2.8 Bln', 'text': '3M REPORTS SALES INFORMATION FOR MONTH OF JULY 2020.3M CO - SALES OF $2.8 BILLION, UP 6 PERCENT YEAR-ON-YEAR FOR JULY.3M CO - JULY ORGANIC LOCAL-CURRENCY SALES GROWTH OF 3 PERCENT YEAR-ON-YEAR.3M CO - ON A GEOGRAPHIC BASIS, TOTAL SALES INCREASED 10 PERCENT IN AMERICAS, 3 PERCENT IN EMEA IN JULY.3M CO - TOTAL SALES INCREASED 29% IN HEALTH CARE, 9% IN CONSUMER, AND 6% IN SAFETY AND INDUSTRIAL IN JULY.3M CO - ON A GEOGRAPHIC BASIS, TOTAL SALES WERE FLAT IN ASIA PACIFIC IN JULY.'}{'symbol': 'AFL', 'date': '2020-08-13 00:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Aflac Says Board Of Directors Increases Shares Authorized For Repurchase', 'text': 'AFLAC INCORPORATED BOARD OF DIRECTORS INCREASES SHARES AUTHORIZED FOR REPURCHASE.AFLAC INC- ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS AUTHORIZED PURCHASE OF UP TO 100 MILLION SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK.AFLAC- AUTHORIZATION IS IN ADDITION TO 21.9 MILLION SHARES AS OF JUNE 30, THAT REMAINED UNDER AUGUST 8, 2017 AUTHORIZATION.AFLAC- STEP BRINGS TOTAL NUMBER OF SHARES AVAILABLE FOR PURCHASE TO APPROXIMATELY 121.9 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'AAL', 'date': '2020-08-13 12:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Neste To Supply Sustainable Aviation Fuel To Three Major U.S. Airlines', 'text': 'NESTE TO SUPPLY SUSTAINABLE AVIATION FUEL TO THREE MAJOR U.S. AIRLINES.IS SUPPLYING ALASKA AIRLINES, AMERICAN AIRLINES AND JETBLUE WITH SUSTAINABLE AVIATION FUEL FOR FLIGHTS FROM SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (SFO).'}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2020-08-13 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cisco Announces Restructuring Plan', 'text': 'CISCO - ON AUGUST 12, 2020, CISCO ANNOUNCED A RESTRUCTURING PLAN.CISCO - RESTRUCTURING PLAN INCLUDES A VOLUNTARY EARLY RETIREMENT PROGRAM.CISCO - CISCO CURRENTLY ESTIMATES THAT IT WILL RECOGNIZE PRE-TAX CHARGES TO ITS GAAP FINANCIAL RESULTS OF APPROXIMATELY $900 MILLION.CISCO - CISCO WILL TAKE ACTION UNDER PLAN BEGINNING IN Q1 OF FISCAL 2021..'}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'da